// EASCape: Ancient Magicks, from Void (data/skill/magic/spells.tables.toml: max hits divided by 10, XP as is,
// heals, poison, drains) and the 377 cache's spellbook interface (inter_267: levels and runes from its
// buttons). Freeze lengths from the OSRS wiki (Void's 3/6/9/12 don't match its own bind's 8). Teleport
// places from Void's teleport areas. Sounds for smoke and shadow are our choice (none in the 377 cache).

